=== file: README.md ===
# Interview question preparation

This workflow drafts interview questions from a role description, independently reviews them, and requires explicit human approval before returning a list marked ready for use.

The drafter treats the role description as data. The reviewer separates cleared, disputed, and removed questions. Disputed questions stay out unless a human resolves them and the reviewer subsequently clears them. Unclear dispute decisions get one clarification request; unresolved questions remain excluded. A human must approve the exact proposed list before the workflow returns `APPROVED_FOR_USE`.

Run the logic tests with:

```text
weave test main.loom
```

The tests use scripted responses and do not call models or send anything. Each agent's instructions are versioned in `prompts/`.
